'''Neel's home''' was the home of the [[Myykian]] [[youngling]]s [[Neel]], [[Jobo]], [[Jorko]], [[Tuloo]] and their parents on the [[planet]] [[At Attin]] during the [[New Republic Era]].<ref name="Real Adventure" /> 

In [[9 ABY]]<ref name="SCDate">{{SkeletonCrewDate}}</ref>, after missing the [[Career Assessment Test]], the [[human]] [[Wim]] came to home looking for Neel. He asked Tuloo where Neel was through the window and they pointed up, indicating that Neel was upstairs. Neel then proceeded to climb the outside of the house to a skylight overlooking a tub where Neel was taking a bath. Wim and Neel then both headed to the home's garage to get [[shovel]]s to excavate the ''[[Onyx Cinder]],'' which Wim found in the forest.<ref name="Real Adventure" />

==Behind the scenes==
Neel's home first appeared in "[[This Could Be a Real Adventure]]"<ref name="Real Adventure" /> the first episode of the live-action [[Disney+]] series ''[[Star Wars: Skeleton Crew]]'', which aired on [[December 2]], [[2024]].<ref name="Early">{{SW|url=news/skeleton-crew-premiere-date|text=''Star Wars: Skeleton Crew'' Will Debut Early|date=2024-11-26}}</ref>

